3. $h.\mathrm{time} \le \nu + 7200$ (non-strict integer inequality; $7200$ is the constant `MAX_FUTURE_BLOCK_TIME`);
4. the negation
$$\neg\Bigl[\bigl(h.\mathrm{version} < 2 \wedge 227931 \le p + 1\bigr) \vee \bigl(h.\mathrm{version} < 3 \wedge 363725 \le p + 1\bigr) \vee \bigl(h.\mathrm{version} < 4 \wedge 388381 \le p + 1\bigr)\Bigr],$$
with $227931$, $363725$, $388381$ the constants `BIP34Height`, `BIP66Height`, `BIP65Height`, integer comparisons on $h.\mathrm{version}$, and natural-number addition $p + 1$.

